{"name":"-37-4-1","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreen","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreen","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Room","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"She never bloomed before she met her end. She entered the tomb the way a king would reclaim his lost land. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Even after a layer of dust settled upon the coffin lid, none understood this true virtuoso's bid. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Her loneliness was a never-flowering bud, sprouted amidst brambled thorns in the mud."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreen","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Even as days and years flow by, your beauty remains unchanged."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"TT33","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"240","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreen","raw":"黑屏2"}],"speaker":"Tokarev","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Miss PK, what's the situation?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"PK","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"PK","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No sign of MIss MDR around the church.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"There's no sign of a struggle either.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"MLEMK1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lee Enfield","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"MDR is an exemplary T-Doll. She wouldn't have disappeared without a word."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"TT33","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Tokarev","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So what do we do now?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"MLEMK1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lee Enfield","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Search the whole mansion. We have to find MDR's whereabouts."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"56-1type","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Type 56-1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Roger that.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"G36C","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Gr G36c","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Understood.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"TT33","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Tokarev","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You too. We've got to find Miss MDR."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"PPSh41","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"PPSh-41","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"G-Got it!","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"PK","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"PK","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Leave it to us.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"StenMK2","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"STEN MkII","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Alright.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"MLEMK1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lee Enfield","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I'm really sorry about this. My team is causing you trouble."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"TT33","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Tokarev","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Nyet, you don't have to apologize. This is something beyond your control. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"So, should we join the search as well?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"MLEMK1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lee Enfield","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yes, of course. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I think I might have an idea."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"TT33","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Tokarev","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"An idea?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"MLEMK1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lee Enfield","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Since 56-1 had come across the electrical room earlier, it didn't take us much time to get to it. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"MDR had only that amount of time to leave the church, so it can be surmised that she couldn't have gone too far. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If she had been attacked, it wouldn't be a stretch to say that it occurred somewhere near the church."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"TT33","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Tokarev","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I see. Such reasoning is full of clarity. You truly live up to your name, Miss Lee. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Then let's hurry up and find her."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"MLEMK1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lee Enfield","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We don't have to rush. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Visibility was extremely limited in this pitch dark mansion before we restored the power supply. MDR doesn't have night vision equipment with her. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Which means she'd have left traces along the way. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We'll be able to find her by following those traces."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"TT33","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Tokarev","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I see your point... Keen observations and an agile mind. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You're just like a certain famous detective, Miss Lee. He also happened to be British. What's his name... Sher...?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"MLEMK1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lee Enfield","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Sherlock Holmes. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Please don't make fun of me, Tokarev. This is all just simple inductive reasoning."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"TT33","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Tokarev","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm not making fun of you. I'm just genuinely impressed. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Your presence really is reassuring. While I wasn't aware of your involvement beforehand, I now find myself glad for it."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"MLEMK1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lee Enfield","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Speaking of which, I've been wondering, Tokarev... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"When did you arrive at the mansion?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"TT33","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Tokarev","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Not long ago. We'd only just got here when we ran into your team. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We entered through the garden in the back."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"MLEMK1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lee Enfield","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I see. We came in through the front door at 8pm. No wonder we didn't see each other."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"TT33","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Tokarev","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"8pm... That's around the time I received my orders."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"MLEMK1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lee Enfield","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I find it really strange – questionable even – that the Commander sent you in without telling you anything or waiting for my report."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"TT33","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Tokarev","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"True, the Commander almost never gives such confusing orders. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We've also been kept completely clueless about the situation in the mansion. Have you discovered anything extraordinary, Miss Lee?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"MLEMK1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lee Enfield","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"All too many. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It's most disconcerting when you find yourself up against something so full of openings. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The most obvious would be the bizarre church. You've seen it, right?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"TT33","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Tokarev","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Da...the one bang in the center of the mansion, you mean? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Those wedding gowns sure are gorgeous. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I bet you'll look stunning in one of them."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"MLEMK1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lee Enfield","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"They're gorgeous, yes, but also glaringly suspicious. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Whether it's the works of ghosts or living people, we're very much being mocked."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"TT33","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Tokarev","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Indeed... Do you believe in ghosts, Miss Lee?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"MLEMK1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lee Enfield","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I don't. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Malice is malice, be it from humans or ghosts. Our enemy is simply malice and evil in the collective sense."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"TT33","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Tokarev","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"How profound. I hope I could be as single-minded and straightforward as you."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_rifle_finalshot_n","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Bang!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"TT33","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Tokarev","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Gunfire!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"MLEMK1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lee Enfield","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Lee Enfield here. Report, who fired just now?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"56-1type","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Type 56-1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm copying, Leader.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"MLEMK1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lee Enfield","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"This is Lee. Report, 56-1."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"56-1type","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Type 56-1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We found MDR.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"MLEMK1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lee Enfield","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Good. Put her through. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I have some questions for her."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"56-1type","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Type 56-1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"MLEMK1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lee Enfield","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Is something the matter?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"56-1type","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Type 56-1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You'd better come see for yourself...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"MLEMK1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lee Enfield","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What's wrong?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"56-1type","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Type 56-1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"To put it simply...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She crashed.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We can't reboot her neural cloud.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"MLEMK1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lee Enfield","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Where are you?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"56-1type","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_whitenoise","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Type 56-1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We're all—","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Pzzzt—","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Pzzzzzzt—","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"TT33","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tele_disconnect","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Tokarev","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Miss Lee! It's an electronic assault!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"MLEMK1","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreen","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"Lee Enfield","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Stay where you are! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'm coming right now!"}]}]}]}
